                                "sense_id": "dc41a703-1885-33ec-a29e-29675fb11410",
                                "text": "There was, also, among the company a mannered, bellied person called Alured Castorley […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8bc58090-b862-3f3e-8310-6b42fc8d5772",
                        "entry_id": "43f4e651-e050-3e41-8f06-a4d560dc0455",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Having a belly of a specified type."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "in-compounds",
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e5fde186-a8de-4feb-b03c-0908164f9cf3",
                                "sense_id": "8bc58090-b862-3f3e-8310-6b42fc8d5772",
                                "text": "full-bellied knife"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a81b881c-39a3-45e7-97db-3a6306f7c48e",
                                "sense_id": "8bc58090-b862-3f3e-8310-6b42fc8d5772",
                                "text": "round-bellied vase"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7a215f61-e533-422e-88e9-d55ae640ead6",
                                "sense_id": "8bc58090-b862-3f3e-8310-6b42fc8d5772",
                                "text": "But one guy was still yelping: a big-bellied biker, with a long, black beard that hung halfway down his bloated gut."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2410159b-51dc-3cab-bc18-76644b385b2d",
                        "entry_id": "43f4e651-e050-3e41-8f06-a4d560dc0455",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Swollen, bulging, or billowing; bellying."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d8184ae3-f3b9-404d-bf1d-50f3f7218fb3",
                                "sense_id": "2410159b-51dc-3cab-bc18-76644b385b2d",
                                "text": "1819, Joseph Rodman Drake, “The American Flag” in The Culprit Fay, and Other Poems, New York: Van Norden & King, 1847, p. 91,\nFlag of the seas! on ocean wave\nThy stars shall glitter o’er the brave;\nWhen death, careering on the gale,\nSweeps darkly round the bellied sail,"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a94a9ba1-5683-4f61-a7eb-71e3707cc540",
                                "sense_id": "2410159b-51dc-3cab-bc18-76644b385b2d",
                                "text": "We heard the swarming streets, the noisy mills;\nSaw sooty foundries full of glare and gloom,\nGreat bellied chimneys tipped with tongues of flame,\nQuiver in smoky heat."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "40782e06-d044-4a4e-91e9-6638d74eec8d",
                                "sense_id": "2410159b-51dc-3cab-bc18-76644b385b2d",
                                "text": "Hand-like rushed the vintage; we strung the bellied skins\nPlump, and at the sealing the Youth’s voice rose:"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ad6f08c8-dfe5-38e0-9267-5b217e64fd85",
                        "entry_id": "43f4e651-e050-3e41-8f06-a4d560dc0455",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Overblown, exaggerated."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively",
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "50b10f78-4fe3-4469-8e24-1fa20b5cd6ba",
                                "sense_id": "ad6f08c8-dfe5-38e0-9267-5b217e64fd85",
                                "text": "[…] the choicest of his friends,\nSuch as would blush to talk such serious follies,\nOr back such bellied commendations […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
